---
import Legal from '../../components/Legal.astro';
import { ENROLMENT } from '../../data/academy';
---
<Legal
  site="academy"
  title="Terms & Conditions — Tisvia Marketing Academy"
  heading="Terms &amp; conditions"
  description="The terms that apply to enrolling in and attending the Tisvia Marketing Academy performance marketing course."
  updated="10 November 2026"
>
  <p>
    These terms apply to this website and to the performance marketing course run by Tisvia
    Marketing Academy. By enrolling, you accept them.
  </p>

  <h2>About us</h2>
  <p>
    Tisvia Marketing Academy is the training arm of Tisvia Marketing, a performance marketing
    agency based in Kerala, India.
  </p>

  <h2>The course</h2>
  <p>
    The course is <strong>ten live online sessions, two hours a day</strong>, taught in Malayalam
    and English, with Ads Manager on screen. Sessions are recorded. Enrolment includes the live
    sessions, the recordings, ten assignments with individual feedback, case studies, templates and
    checklists, a final project and a Certificate of Completion.
  </p>
  <p>
    We may change the schedule, the order of topics or the platform used, and we may move a session
    where we have to. We will tell you in advance.
  </p>

  <h2>Enrolment and fee</h2>
  <p>
    The fee is <strong>{ENROLMENT.fee} {ENROLMENT.feeUnit}</strong>. Your place is confirmed when
    the fee is paid in full. Seats in a batch are limited and are allocated in order of payment.
  </p>
  <p>
    Enrolment is personal to you. You may not share your session link, your recordings or your
    course material with anyone else, and you may not transfer your seat without asking us first.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising spend</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>Live advertising spend is not included in the fee.</strong> You build and launch real
    campaigns during the course. Any money spent on those ads is paid by you, directly to the
    platform. You decide the budget, and you can learn without spending if you prefer.
  </p>

  <h2>Certificate</h2>
  <p>
    The Certificate of Completion is issued once you have submitted the assignments and completed
    the final assessment. It is a certificate from Tisvia Marketing Academy. It is
    <strong>not</strong> a Meta certification, a university qualification or a government-recognised
    award.
  </p>

  <h2>Results, income and jobs</h2>
  <p>
    <strong>We do not guarantee any result.</strong> The course gives you training, practice and
    feedback. What you earn, which clients you get and how your campaigns perform depend on your own
    work, your market and the platforms. We do not offer job placement. Student and client results
    shown on our site are theirs, not a promise of yours.
  </p>

  <h2>Course material</h2>
  <p>
    Recordings, slides, templates and checklists stay our property and are licensed to you for your
    own learning. Do not record the sessions yourself, re-upload them, resell them, or share them in
    any group or channel. Breaking this can end your enrolment without a refund, and we may act on
    it further.
  </p>

  <h2>Conduct</h2>
  <p>
    Treat the mentor and the other students with respect. We may remove anyone from the sessions or
    the class group for abusive behaviour, spamming, selling to other students, or sharing course
    material. Removal on these grounds does not entitle you to a refund.
  </p>

  <h2>Attendance</h2>
  <p>
    Sessions run at fixed times. If you miss one, the recording is there — we cannot repeat a live
    session for one student. Missing sessions is not a ground for a refund.
  </p>

  <h2>Post-course support</h2>
  <p>
    A WhatsApp group and doubt-clearing sessions after the programme are
    <strong>proposed, not promised</strong>. They are a courtesy and are not part of what you pay
    for.
  </p>

  <h2>If we change or cancel a batch</h2>
  <p>
    We may postpone or cancel a batch. If we do, you can move to the next batch or take a full
    refund. See the <a href="/refund/">Refunds &amp; cancellation policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the extent the law allows, we are not liable for indirect or consequential loss, including
    advertising spend, lost profit or lost business opportunity. Our total liability for any claim
    is limited to the course fee you paid. Nothing here limits liability that cannot lawfully be
    limited.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>
    These terms are governed by the laws of India. The courts at Thrissur, Kerala have exclusive
    jurisdiction over any dispute.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms. The date at the top of the page shows when they last changed.
  </p>
</Legal>
